                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. Add one line for "Labor – 3 hours  $45/hr", another for "Mulch – 10 yards  $35/yd", and another for "Plant material – 5 shrubs  $25 each". Each line can have its own description, quantity, rate, and tax.
                    </div>
